{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126090732077-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126111102\"/><p>今日(26日)為大埔宏福苑大火一周年，大火奪去168條人命，亦令數以千計居民痛失家園。今早陸續有市民到宏福苑旁邊的廣福公園獻花，在長椅上擺放鮮花。有部分人獻花後，閉目、雙手合十，在心中悼念罹難者。有市民在花束上留下卡片，寫上「希望逝者安息，公義得以彰顯」。罹難者遺屬放下花束，卡片寫上「杰仔：爸爸來看你了！」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:19:46.506193+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:07:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T03:13:03.619572+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:13:03.619572+00:00","content_hash":"bfaf3537da0f8892a75f83e131488345aa432002d529b981adba872c7103e3e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}